{"org":"elastic","repo":"elasticsearch","prNumber":"114990","commit":"de96932eeae689053d9dc52d99950bd6fa0ae2bf","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The method `QueryRewriteContext.getTierPreference(QueryRewriteContext context)` is introduced to retrieve the tier preference from the context. However, it checks if the context is an instance of `CoordinatorRewriteContext` and then casts it. This approach can lead to issues if other subclasses of `QueryRewriteContext` are introduced in the future that also need to provide a tier preference. A more flexible solution would be to add a method `getTierPreference()` to the `QueryRewriteContext` class itself, which could be overridden by subclasses like `CoordinatorRewriteContext`. This would eliminate the need for type checking and casting.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryRewriteContext.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryRewriteContext.java-3010:3732-16060:17012","promptId":"#PBB5M","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryRewriteContext.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/QueryRewriteContext.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":3010,"endPos":3732,"startLine":84,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":99,"endLineOffset":9,"length":723}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":16060,"endPos":17012,"startLine":414,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":435,"endLineOffset":5,"length":953}]},{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/CoordinatorRewriteContext.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/CoordinatorRewriteContext.java--2020:2073,2079:3587","promptId":"#84XS4","srcPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/CoordinatorRewriteContext.java","dstPath":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/CoordinatorRewriteContext.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2020,"endPos":2073,"startLine":42,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":42,"endLineOffset":57,"length":54},{"pos":2079,"endPos":3587,"startLine":44,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":81,"endLineOffset":6,"length":1509}]}]},{"comment":"The new test `testCanMatchSkipsPartiallyMountedIndicesWhenFrozenNodesUnavailable` is comprehensive and covers various scenarios involving term, terms, bool term, bool match, and bool prefix/wildcard queries. However, it would be beneficial to add more boundary conditions, such as testing with no documents in the indices or with very large document counts, to ensure robustness.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java-x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java--53410:61387","promptId":"#7X9WM","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/searchable-snapshots/src/internalClusterTest/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/searchablesnapshots/SearchableSnapshotsCanMatchOnCoordinatorIntegTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":53410,"endPos":61387,"startLine":974,"startLineOffset":4,"endLine":1111,"endLineOffset":5,"length":7978}]}]},{"comment":"The methods `doIndexMetadataRewrite` in `WildcardQueryBuilder`, `PrefixQueryBuilder`, `TermQueryBuilder`, and `TermsQueryBuilder` have been moved to `doCoordinatorRewrite`. This change is consistent with the introduction of coordinator rewrites. However, it\u0027s important to ensure that all query types that might be rewritten on the coordinator are updated similarly. A review should be conducted to identify any other query types that might need this change.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/WildcardQueryBuilder.java-server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/index/query/WildcardQueryBuilder.java-8512:8